    <title>Nhiệm vụ 6 | Nguyên tắc đạo đức AI</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #0d1117; color: #c9d1d9; margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
